    "Person360": {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"personPublicId":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Uuid"},"asOf":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Instant"},"displayName":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"workerStatus":{"type":"string","enum":["PREHIRE","ACTIVE","INACTIVE","TERMINATED"]},"relationships":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Uuid"}},"assignments":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Uuid"}},"projectionRevision":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"required":["personPublicId","asOf","displayName","workerStatus","relationships","assignments","projectionRevision"]},
